1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,077
Chaliye pehli baar FLOWRA mein login karte hain.

2
00:00:03,077 --> 00:00:06,090
Sabse pehle browser mein flowralive.in kholiye.

3
00:00:06,090 --> 00:00:10,577
Upar right corner mein aapko Login button dikhega — usko click kijiye.

4
00:00:10,577 --> 00:00:14,232
Ab do cheezein daalni hain — aapka username aur password.

5
00:00:14,232 --> 00:00:18,976
Yeh dono aapko onboarding ke time diye gaye the — email pe ya WhatsApp pe.

6
00:00:18,976 --> 00:00:22,694
Nahi mile toh apne FLOWRA representative se poochh lijiye.

7
00:00:22,694 --> 00:00:25,323
Password daalne ke baad Sign In dabaaiye.

8
00:00:25,323 --> 00:00:26,723
Bas!

9
00:00:26,723 --> 00:00:29,672
Aap seedha apne Dashboard pe pahunch jaayenge.

10
00:00:29,672 --> 00:00:33,198
Ek zaroori baat agar aap pehli baar login kar rahe hain

11
00:00:33,198 --> 00:00:36,147
toh system aapko ek chhota sa tour dikhaayega.

12
00:00:36,147 --> 00:00:40,185
Uspe dhyaan dijiye — 30 second mein sab kuch samajh aa jaayega.

13
00:00:40,185 --> 00:00:42,311
Agla video mein hum Dashboard ka pura tour karenge.
